# {{ .Project }} Local DDD Desktop

Prism/DryIoc WPF application with local Clean Architecture layers. This profile has no WebApi and no HTTP dependency.

```text
Desktop -> Infrastructure -> Application -> Domain
```

## Build and run

```powershell
dotnet restore .\{{ .Project }}.sln
dotnet build .\{{ .Project }}.sln
dotnet run --project .\src\Desktop\{{ .Project }}.Desktop.csproj
```

SQLite is the default local database. Add domain entities with:

```powershell
aspgen add entity Book title:string pages:int published:date --project .
```
